## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to enforce strict tenant isolation in streaming joins, manage per-tenant offsets, and design fault containment so one tenant's failure cannot affect others.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant offset tracking and commit granularity
- Tenant-scoped state for windowed joins
- Fault isolation and backpressure handling
- Canary test design for multi-tenant flows

## Code Example
